Agent-02 Light Concept: Atmospheric Lantern

Implementation:
- Three-layer radial gradient system (core, mid, outer)
- Eased cursor following via requestAnimationFrame
- Smooth 0.08 easing factor for organic movement
- Natural falloff from bright white core to soft mauve haze

Technical:
- 60fps animation loop
- No React state thrashing (uses refs for target position)
- Proper cleanup on unmount

What makes it feel like light:
- Layered depth (not flat)
- Inertia in movement (not locked to cursor)
- Gradual falloff (not hard edges)
- White-hot core transitioning to warm glow
